{"detail": {"templateUuid": "d5688f3fb36a4ffcba041b9300324764", "projectUuid": "4c17cc3bc1c449f8aff6e6ab138f97d4", "name": "我才不是坏孩子", "description": "小学时，男孩和同学打了一架，被老师叫到放学后的教室里等家长。对方的家长很快来了，而男孩家里的电话却始终无人接听。黄昏的教室慢慢安静下来，走廊里的声音越来越远，男孩嘴上仍然不服气，却在一次次等待音里慢慢低下了头。\n\n老师一开始只是按规矩处理一场普通的学生纠纷。直到电话无人接通，她才意识到，这个孩子真正害怕的也许不是被批评，而是没人来、没人问、没人替他说一句话。她没有拆穿他的难堪，也没有多说安慰的话。\n\n多年后，已经毕业的男孩重新想起那个黄昏。他记得的不是老师讲过什么大道理，而是有人曾经在他最不想被看见的时候，轻轻替他保住了体面。", "coverUrl": "/assets/db43258f6edfd82e.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/6a7b9d6670b64c7b8c811d8ae2d67ac9/7ab62c69ad0b35256344ae641850dc79779f4333.mp4", "snapshotId": 22984, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 5145020, "ownerUuid": "6a7b9d6670b64c7b8c811d8ae2d67ac9", "avatar": "/assets/3f0042e7cfc9dbe4.webp", "nickname": "Nl", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 5, "tags": [{"id": 3040, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "广告导演请就位", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3040/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 3041, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "1-创意TVC", "parentTag": 3040, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3040/3041", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 1106, "code": "corporate", "tagLabel": "企业宣传", "parentTag": 1100, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1100/1106/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 6, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1201, "code": "short_series", "tagLabel": "短片剧集", "parentTag": 1200, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1200/1201/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1104, "code": "creative_tvc", "tagLabel": "创意TVC", "parentTag": 1100, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1100/1104/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 4, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "42 【短片创作 剧情短片 电影感 Lib广告导演请就位 - Nl | 小红书 - 你的生活兴趣社区】 😆 w3tuuzVlOnf6RL4 😆 https://www.xiaohongshu.com/discovery/item/6a4339b8000000001102e1b5?source=webshare&xhsshare=pc_web&xsec_token=AB7jb5o26ByVeS4n